# Out of the corridor (as city.steps), then a full turn on the spot in eighths: looking back at the
# corridor, and the sky and the ground as you turn (the user's artefacts 3 and 4).
# Film it: tests\e2e\run_e2e.ps1 -Steps city_turn.steps
# Out of the corridor into Work RAM's city (game/city.h), booted on foot. The route (2026-11-08,
# after the parkour moves): a run up the left half, over the crate and up the stairs, over the
# platform onto the low roof (64), stopped by the tower. A strafe left (south, +y) pushes off the
# low roof's edge onto the floor of the corridor's right half. Then on, out of the corridor's open
# end onto the entry tower's roof (level with the floor): the city below.
# Each stage ends against something (the tower, the right half's floor), so it doesn't hang on timing.
wait_up
keydown up
wait 8.5
keyup up
hold l 2.2
wait 0.3
keydown up
wait 1.8
keyup up
wait 0.5
shot ctn_00
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_01
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_02
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_03
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_04
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_05
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_06
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_07
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_08
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_09
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_10
hold right 0.2
shot ctn_11
